1
00:00:01,000 --> 00:00:05,000
Welcome to StockSense — the predictive and explainable inventory intelligence platform.

2
00:00:05,500 --> 00:00:10,000
Most ERPs only record what already happened; StockSense predicts what will happen next.

3
00:00:10,500 --> 00:00:16,000
Here on the Executive Dashboard, we track real-time active SKUs, stockout alerts, and inventory valuation.

4
00:00:16,500 --> 00:00:22,500
Every single quantity is backed by an immutable double-entry ledger that guarantees 100% balance invariants.

5
00:00:23,000 --> 00:00:28,500
Our AI Intelligence Engine generates adaptive demand forecasts, safety stocks, and dynamic reorder points.

6
00:00:29,000 --> 00:00:34,500
Every recommendation is accompanied by plain-English explainability bullets for procurement teams.

7
00:00:35,000 --> 00:00:40,000
The Anomaly Radar flags shrinkage, dead stock, sudden demand spikes, and supplier delays.

8
00:00:40,500 --> 00:00:46,000
Warehouse staff can switch to Worker Touch Mode for mobile receiving, FEFO picking, and cycle counts.

9
00:00:46,500 --> 00:00:52,000
With automated email dispatching and multi-role RBAC security, StockSense is production-ready.
